 and the belt all at the same time and he  was mostly successful  it appears that he was trying to destroy  tycho's station  so he wasn't able to pull that off but  he did get the proto-molecule sample  and fred johnson is dead in the books  that's a big failure because they try to  kill fred and it doesn't happen  i thought the acting in this episode was  really superb across the board there  were so many standout scenes and  everybody pulled their weight  i already mentioned it but naomi phillip  and marco all did an incredible job i  was actually surprised how powerful the  clarissa and amos scene was  they both did a really good job there  avasarala  delgado nancy gal really no weak spots  there i really enjoyed zakai's  performance  and with fred dying i think there's a  distinct possibility that we'll see  bull's role increase i have to say that  even though monica saved holden twice i  was a hundred percent with him to go  after the proto molecule  i saw some comments where people were  saying that he completely forgot about  what was going on with monica and was  distracted by the proto-molecule  but i'm here to say i would be too i  think his priorities were exactly right  there  regardless it did get away we didn't see  any drummer in this episode and i'm  curious as to where her story will go  of course her and fred left things on  bad terms but we have to imagine that  she had respect for the man and feeling  so now marco has killed fred johnson and  ashford and i can't wait to see how she  reacts to that  earth may be safe for more attacks now  it certainly looked that way at the end  of the episode  we've had three rocks hit the first hit  near the city of dakar  the second in north america not far from  philadelphia  and the third in south asia it's a  little suspicious that nancy gal  happened to be so near where that third  rock hit  but i'm not sure if there's something  else going on there we opened with alex  and bobby and we still don't know what's  going on with the bar keith i think i'll  do another video in a few days where  i'll look at where everybody  ended and what that sets up for the next  episode it'll be similar to the preview  video i did yesterday  because a lot of stuff is still up in  the air i am very much looking forward  to see what happens with amos and  peaches  i think it's a little bit of a  surprising matchup but i love seeing  these two together in the books  and they're in a pretty serious  situation at this point  in the episode it said that her  penitentiary was in the chesapeake  conservancy zone  and based on what we saw we can expect  that it's somewhat close to that second  impact site so he went underground and  when he goes back up things are not  going to be the same  the way they introduced the attacks in  the books was through his  perspective and he did the same thing  the attack with the first rock was  playing on the news feed as he was  sitting in the waiting room  and he was more concerned with the chair  he was sitting on  whether he could break it away if he  could use it as a weapon  rather than what was going on on the  news and there was  somewhat of a lack of reaction through  all the characters  in this episode i think it's kind of one  of those events where  you take the information in but it  doesn't really sink in it's almost like  your mind can't process it your survival  instinct kicks in  but it's not till later until you really  understand the scope of what happened  and we'll have to wait and see i think  it's safe to say that things will not be  the same  on earth ever again but we won't know  how bad the situation is until we learn  more and i think that's a good place to  leave it let me know in the comments  what you thought  if you're a show only person did you  expect this to happen  if you're a book reader how shocked were  you at fred's death  make sure if you're gonna talk about  stuff that happened in the books you  mark any spoilers  please like this video if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already i'll have another video  coming in the next couple of days  and plenty more throughout the season  thanks for watching i'll talk to you  soon
 

